  "description": "The long-awaited update to the bestselling Endura T22 is here, and it’s one of Innokin’s most versatile and user-friendly vape kits yet. Featuring a longer-lasting 3000mAh battery, the new Endura T22 Pro adds super-fast USB charging to the device letting you charge your kit quicker than ever. The durable aluminium and zinc alloy makes the Endura T22 Pro a lightweight and stylish vape kit that feels great in the hand. Beneath the hood, the Endura T22 Pro provides 9.5 - 13.5 watts of adjustable wattage across 4 power levels that are adjusted with a simple button. A handy power level indicator lights up on the body of the device to display your current wattage range. The Endura T22 Pro vape kit includes the fantastic 2ml Innokin T18E Pro tank. With a top-filling design, refilling your e-liquid is quick, simple and mess free, while transparent e-liquid windows on each side of the tank lets you easily track your e-liquid levels. The Innokin T18E Pro tank is compatible with Innokin’s high-performance T18E/M18 coils, with two 1.7ohm T18 Coils included with your kit. These coils are perfect at delivering a satisfying, flavoursome MTL (mouth-to-lung) style vape, especially when used with 50/50 , nic salts or high-PG e-liquids Want to use a different tank with the Endura T22 Pro? That’s easy too, thanks to the kit’s 510-connection. Simple to use, versatile and oozing the premium quality we’ve come to expect from Innokin, the Endura T22 Pro with included T18E Pro tank is a great device for all levels of vaper. Explore our vape liquid and discover a delicious companion for this kit. Please note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
